-criterion that allocating space to any file or directory in the set
-will reduce the &quot;quota_avail_hard&quot; of every other file or directory
-in the set.</t>
-            <t indent="0" pn="section-5.8.2.26-2">Note that there may be a number of distinct but overlapping sets of
-files or directories for which a quota_used value is maintained,
