+                    <dd pn="section-6.2.1.3.1-22.1.1.4">Permission to delete a file or directory within a directory.
+See <xref target="section-6.2.1.3.2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 6.2.1.3.2"/> for information on how ACE4_DELETE and
