+                <li pn="section-6.2.1.3.1-26.1">
+                  <dl newline="true" spacing="normal" indent="3" pn="section-6.2.1.3.1-26.1.1">
+                    <dt pn="section-6.2.1.3.1-26.1.1.1">Operation(s) affected:</dt>
+                    <dd pn="section-6.2.1.3.1-26.1.1.2">SETATTR of time_access_set, time_backup, time_create,
+time_modify_set, mimetype, hidden, and system</dd>
+                    <dt pn="section-6.2.1.3.1-26.1.1.3">Discussion:</dt>
+                    <dd pn="section-6.2.1.3.1-26.1.1.4">Permission to change the times associated with a file or
+directory to an arbitrary value.  Also, permission to change
+the mimetype, hidden and system attributes.  A user having
+ACE4_WRITE_DATA or ACE4_WRITE_ATTRIBUTES will be allowed to set
+the times associated with a file to the current server time.</dd>
