           <t indent="0" pn="section-16.34.5-1">The client must use the SETCLIENTID_CONFIRM operation to confirm the
 following two distinct cases:</t>
           <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-16.34.5-2">
-            <li pn="section-16.34.5-2.1"> The client's use of a new shorthand client identifier (as returned
